#. module: corporate_gifts
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:corporate_gifts.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Once the frame is Done, The "
"Serigraphy Task is automatically moved</font></strong> to \"Frame Received\" "
"+ Green (Studio automated Action)"
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ເມື່ອຂອບບລັອກສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ວຽກງານ ການສະກຣີນຈະຖື"
"ກຍ້າຍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ</font></strong> ໄປທີ່ \"ໄດ້ຮັບຂອບບລັອກແລ້ວ\" + ສີຂຽວ (ການກະທຳອັດຕະໂນມັ"
"ດຂອງ Studio)"

#. module: corporate_gifts
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:corporate_gifts.services
msgid ""
"Adapt these three columns to fit your design need. To duplicate, delete or "
